This revision is built by tools/desktop/build-textedit.sh, which
foxyn-desktop(8) runs on the desktop image (tools/linux/build.sh desktop):
it downloads the revision's archive and checks its SHA-256. It is
not part of buildworld. Keep build output outside the submodule. When
upgrading, update the revision and checksum in build-textedit.sh too.

A source bundle was tested separately; packaging and file-level provenance remain incomplete.

License: MIT in LICENSE with other file-level notices; see docs/desktop-textedit.md. Complete file-level and asset provenance review and preserve
applicable notices and source obligations before distribution.

When upgrading, review dependencies, API and ABI compatibility, FoxynBSD
portability, license notices and the full desktop build and runtime tests.
